'''Jungle Women''' (犬猿の仲, ''Ken'en no Naka'', '''Enmity''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Strong" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

