==Trivia==
*Jungle Women's Japanese name, Ken'en no Naka (犬猿の仲), literally translates to "Dog-monkey Relationship" and refers to a contentious relationship characterized by mutual hatred or extremely poor relations, like the rivalry between dogs and monkeys. [[Kuu (Uber Rare Cat)|Kuu]] fills the "monkey" role because she's based on [[wikipedia:Sun Wukong|Sun Wukong]] from ''[[wikipedia:Journey to the West|Journey to the West]]''.

